# claude-fleet optional configuration.
#
# Copy to .claude-fleet.conf in your project root to opt in to team-brain
# integration (https://github.com/zoraxl/team-brain). Leave it absent for
# the default fleet workflow — nothing below is required or auto-detected.
#
# Sourced as a shell snippet by every claude-fleet-* script, after
# require_repo runs. Keep it to simple variable assignments.

# Path to a team-brain checkout: absolute, or relative to this repo's root.
TEAM_BRAIN_DIR="../team-brain"
